                    <p class="text-slate-600 text-sm leading-relaxed mb-6 max-w-sm">
                        Zero-knowledge client-side encryption. Protect files and folders directly in your browser using AES-GCM 256-bit cryptography. No accounts, and zero bytes ever uploaded.
